Dantakūra : nt.: Name of a city.

(1) Sahadeva defeated the assembled kings of the southern countries at Dantakūra (yo dantakūre vyajayan nṛdevān samāgatān dākṣiṇātyān mahīpān) 3. 119. 18;

(2) Sahadeva defeated the assembled Kaliṅgas at Dantakūra (sahadevaḥ kaliṅgān samāgatān ajayad dantakūre) 5. 23. 23 (Nī., however, on Bom.
